import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 436 | Dragon Ball · Combat-Power Inflation Critique: Setting Collapse From Hundreds to Infinity","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 436 | Dragon Ball · Combat-Power Inflation Critique: Setting Collapse From Hundreds to Infinity","no":436,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Combat-Power Inflation","Number Collapse","Super Saiyan","Law-First Axiom"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","40-Symbiotic Constitution General Outline"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0436_模块2-龙珠-战力膨胀批判-从几百到无穷的设定崩坏.md","filePath":"en/0436_模块2-龙珠-战力膨胀批判-从几百到无穷的设定崩坏.md"}'),a={name:"en/0436_模块2-龙珠-战力膨胀批判-从几百到无穷的设定崩坏.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,d,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-436-dragon-ball-·-combat-power-inflation-critique-setting-collapse-from-hundreds-to-infinity" tabindex="-1">Entry 436 | Dragon Ball · Combat-Power Inflation Critique: Setting Collapse From Hundreds to Infinity <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-436-dragon-ball-·-combat-power-inflation-critique-setting-collapse-from-hundreds-to-infinity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 436 | Dragon Ball · Combat-Power Inflation Critique: Setting Collapse From Hundreds to Infinity&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 5) | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 27, 40</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-the-numbers-themselves-become-the-enemy" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when the numbers themselves become the enemy <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-the-numbers-themselves-become-the-enemy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when the numbers themselves become the enemy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball is comics history&#39;s first work to put &quot;battle-power numbers&quot; on the table, and the first to completely break those numbers. When Raditz pulled out the scouter and said the farmer&#39;s &quot;power level 5,&quot; readers thought this was a rigorous numerical system; by Frieza&#39;s final form numbers jumped to 100 million; readers had given up calculating; by <em>Super</em>, concepts like &quot;Super Saiyan Blue,&quot; &quot;Ultra Instinct&quot; completely detached from numbers, became &quot;who plot needs who is strong.&quot; This entry takes the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> as core, dissecting Dragon Ball combat-power inflation&#39;s whole process, and why Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-realms system can root out this collapse.</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Combat-power inflation itself is the greatest energy waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Old numbers invalidated</strong>: Master Roshi 139, Raditz ~1000, Nappa 4000, Vegeta 18000 — these early carefully built number ladders, after Frieza arc all invalidated; readers&#39; early accumulated &quot;number sense&quot; zeroed in one go</li><li><strong>Old strong ones devalued</strong>: Tien Shinhan, Yamcha, Krillin these early strong ones, after combat-power inflation do not even have &quot;sparring&quot; qualification; their cultivation results narratively erased</li><li><strong>Old threats devalued</strong>: King Piccolo, Red Ribbon Army, Tao Pai Pai, these early late-BOSSES become jokes — villains later and later absurd, because early bosses are no longer impressive</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How combat-power inflation causes historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Cultivation path single-ized</strong>: because of number inflation, all cultivators compressed onto the single road of &quot;compare numbers with Goku&quot;; any cultivator not pursuing numbers (e.g., Crane School, Eight-Qigong-Cut style) loses meaning</li><li><strong>Ordinary people completely out</strong>: when numbers inflate from hundreds to hundred-millions, ordinary people do not even have &quot;participate in battle&quot; qualification; civilization further slips to &quot;few strong ones monopolize&quot;</li><li><strong>History discontinuous</strong>: because of number inflation, readers cannot judge &quot;how strong is Goku now&quot;; the worldview&#39;s historical feel reset repeatedly — this is law-tier historical regression</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s predatory thinking in combat-power inflation:</p><ul><li><strong>Number monopoly</strong>: Goku&#39;s number-growth curve far faster than companions; Vegeta chased decades barely caught up; Gohan, Trunks, Goten&#39;s growth curves all pressed by Goku</li><li><strong>Enemy escalation = resource</strong>: every new villain appears, its number must be &quot;slightly higher than Goku,&quot; otherwise cannot continue — this means Dragon Ball world must continuously manufacture stronger enemies; Myriad Ranks continuously pay blood price for Goku&#39;s number inflation</li><li><strong>Transformation layers plunder narrative right</strong>: SSJ1/2/3, God, Blue, Ultra Instinct… each transformation layer is the personal narrative of &quot;I broke through again&quot;; Myriad Ranks have no place in the narrative</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Combat-Power Inflation</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Realm-Stable Framework</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Numbers from hundreds to ∞, no cap</td><td>Nine realms: Sense/Condensed/Transform/Law/Dao Origin, Dao Integration, Boundary-Breaking, World-Creation, Origin; each realm has clear promotion laws</td></tr><tr><td>Transformation layers added with plot</td><td>New dimensions (Multiverse, Balanced Anchor) all via appendix increment; do not overturn old setting</td></tr><tr><td>Villains escalate with numbers</td><td>Anti-predation axiom: do not take killing-predation as evolution path; villains go reform/trial</td></tr><tr><td>Old strong ones devalued</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republican co-build: any stage cultivator has civilization-contribution position</td></tr><tr><td>Number inflation</td><td>Anchor calibration (Doc 027): periodically calibrate energy definitions; prevent narrative devaluation</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball number curve — Raditz arc 1000 → Frieza arc 100 million → Buu arc 10 billion → Super arc God-of-Destruction tier</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;if Dragon Ball rewritten by Heng Yuan Zhou nine-realms framework&quot; control; observe realm stability at the same plot nodes</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count &quot;chapters where readers can still calculate numbers,&quot; &quot;chapters where companion combat power is not devalued&quot;</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Dragon Ball Number-Inflation Rate Report</em>, quantifying &quot;every transformation invalidates how much early setting&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: extremely low</strong>. Battle-power numbers completely abandoned after Namek arc; &quot;ki&quot; magnitude all by character dialogue &quot;feels so strong&quot;; no objective reference</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely high</strong>. Toriyama himself said multiple times &quot;Buu arc should have ended&quot;; late sequels (GT, Super, Heroes) all hard-add numbers in directions he did not want to continue</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high (gift-style-leaning-oligarchic)</strong>. Number inflation&#39;s only beneficiary is Goku; companions are only reference points</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: number inflation devalues all early cultivation results; energy investment zeroed</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: villains continuously &quot;needed&quot; for Goku to level; Myriad-Ranks blood price continuously paid</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s ferocious realm at least has a cap; Goku&#39;s numbers uncapped</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: ordinary people in number inflation completely out; no cultivation qualification</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: numbers single-dimension inflation; no multi-path evolution to expand</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball created numbers, and destroyed numbers. It proved one thing: as long as law does not precede, as long as plot can anytime make &quot;the protagonist got strong again,&quot; any numerical system will inflate to meaninglessness in ten or twenty years. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is the law-first axiom — realms legislated first, expansion via appendix, never solving plot puzzles by &quot;adding another transformation layer.&quot; Dragon Ball&#39;s lesson is the common alarm bell for all long-running combat IPs.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · combat-power inflation critique · setting collapse from hundreds to infinity described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./432_模块2-龙珠-总论悟空与战力膨胀体系定性.html">Entry 432 · Overview</a> · <a href="./443_模块2-龙珠-超级赛亚人变身-战力膨胀的标志性机制.html">Entry 443 · Super Saiyan Transformation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
